WEBVTT

00:00:27.579 --> 00:00:30.829
Jo log hamaare paas aate hain.
.kaise sunate hain?

00:00:30.829 --> 00:00:34.037
[Jis Tarah Se Ham Kaam
Karate Hain]

00:00:34.037 --> 00:00:35.871
[Dropbox ke Amarthan se
Sambhav hua]

00:00:35.871 --> 00:00:37.454
Namaste, mera naam Micah hai

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:39.037
lekin yeh hamesha nahin hai

00:00:39.037 --> 00:00:40.871
Mere kaam kee jagah mein
ek saal

00:00:40.871 --> 00:00:42.912
Mainne bahaar aane kee
prakriya shuroo kee

00:00:42.912 --> 00:00:45.204
Jab mainne maanav 
sansaadhan ke saath baat kee

00:00:45.204 --> 00:00:47.287
ki kaise ko apana parichay kaise den

00:00:47.287 --> 00:00:49.496
hamaare paas uttar nahin the

00:00:49.496 --> 00:00:52.704
Kaam par koee bhee traans ke 
roop mein nahin aaya tha

00:00:52.704 --> 00:00:54.787
lekin yahee kaaran hai ki
main yahaan hoon

00:00:54.787 --> 00:00:57.121
Mushkil cheejon ke baare
men baat karane

00:00:57.121 --> 00:00:58.162
ke teen tips

00:00:58.162 --> 00:01:00.412
Aur vo jo baatacheet ke 
doosare paksh me hain